果和cho臭质质地形成鲜明对比。照明很柔软，突出了她的面部特征和衣服的细节。这张照片非常集中，浅水深度略有模糊，使她成为明显的焦点。这种风格是现代和极简主义的，强调了她黑暗的哥特式美学。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 164, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [547.3163452148438, 476.9078369140625], "pos": [1484.717529296875, 1070.5238037109375], "id": 1013, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["适合新人，功能全部拆开，需要什么功能主页查询，自己拼合组装\n\n寻找其它工作流请点击\n\n\nhttps://www.liblib.art/userpage/2a856218ad634a86ab3bbf6f08c5f293/publish/workflow\n\n\n插件：\nhttps://github.com/EvilBT/ComfyUI_SLK_joy_caption_two\n\n备注：所有文件都下载\n国外模型：https://huggingface.co/google/siglip-so400m-patch14-384\n国内模型：https://hf-mirror.com/google/siglip-so400m-patch14-384\n\n路径：-llama-joycaption-beta-one-hf-llava--\n/ComfyUI/models/LLavacheckpoints/llama-joycaption-beta-one-hf-llava\n\n核心：Nunchaku   文生图\n\n1.模型替换成自己的常用的\n\n2.只展示基础必要功能，都是最精简的，细节其它功能自己调整\n\n3.搭建大型工作流必备\n\n4.插件：https://github.com/mit-han-lab/nunchaku\n\n5.轮子：https://github.com/mit-han-lab/nunchaku/releases/tag/v0.3.1dev20250607  3.0"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [454.4319763183594, 445.5433044433594], "pos": [-827.82275390625, 438.64923095703125], "id": 1030, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [217], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["chinese (simplified)", "english", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [646.1405029296875, 548.9737548828125], "pos": [73.70027923583984, 1027.52490234375], "id": 1027, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_custom_nodes_al